From: Abhishek Kaushik <abhishek.kaushik@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2025 13:02:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] [SDAG[[X86] Add method to scalarize `STRICT_FSETCC`

Fixes #154485
---
